{
  "inShort": "The team is at risk: no build, player-test record or new artifact was shown. The mountain photo and film thumbnail cannot verify the claimed second island or reef damage, leaving actual progress unknown. With Mia’s work unconfirmed this week, only Alex’s 10–15 weekly hours are confirmed for finishing and testing the slice.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu474vj00k1k9z85tgw7gsa",
      "text": "The public Godot demo repository opens with demo folders, an MIT license and import instructions. This closes the reference task, but does not demonstrate the team’s playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu474w200k2k9z8zz6mezdu",
      "text": "The animated art-style reference remains done. Only the Big Buck Bunny title and thumbnail were checked. The animation itself was not watched, so its suitability remains unverified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu474wh00k3k9z823f1jo7o",
      "text": "The playtesting article explains purposes and testing formats, matching the promised reference. It does not establish that five players tested the game."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvu474wy00k4k9z8bbq9qdph",
      "text": "The design board artifact closes the task. No inspection of its contents was supplied."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [
    "cmvu474xb00k5k9z8pgq871bc"
  ],
  "outsidePlan": [],
  "questions": [
    "Does an openable build demonstrate the second island, reef damage, tide loop and two-player sailing?",
    "Have five players tested that build, with records of what they tried and where they struggled?",
    "What hours can Mia commit to the remaining slice?"
  ]
}

